WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,490 --> 00:00:03,490
Make some meat sauce or stew

2
00:00:03,690 --> 00:00:04,890
I also have a coffee duck pot

3
00:00:05,490 --> 00:00:08,720
I almost forgot that there is also Rouxiaoxiao

4
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:12,710
It's okay if you can talk in this space

5
00:00:13,310 --> 00:00:14,710
There's nothing to hide

6
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:19,840
Go and have a rest

7
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:21,440
His face is still white

8
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:22,640
Hands are cold too

9
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:48,700
Why don't you go to bed, little lady?

10
00:00:49,370 --> 00:00:50,370
Let her be fascinated for a while

11
00:00:50,970 --> 00:00:51,970
Now I'm asleep

12
00:00:52,370 --> 00:00:56,700
I can't sleep again at night. Sister Xue, have you really let go?

13
00:00:58,450 --> 00:00:59,450
I won't be a mistress

14
00:00:59,850 --> 00:01:03,050
It’s not enough for my heart to die in one day. It’s been so many years.

15
00:01:04,580 --> 00:01:06,780
I will protect you Fan Jiawen from now on

16
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:08,580
You won't like me
